{
  "id": "JHN.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "John 16",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These things have I spoken unto you, that ye should not be caused to stumble. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall put you out of the synagogues: yea, the hour cometh, that whosoever killeth you shall think that he offereth service unto God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And these things will they do, because they have not known the Father, nor me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But these things have I spoken unto you, that when their hour is come, ye may remember them, how that I told you. And these things I said not unto you from the beginning, because I was with you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But now I go unto him that sent me; and none of you asketh me, Whither goest thou? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But because I have spoken these things unto you, sorrow hath filled your heart. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless I tell you the truth: It is expedient for you that I go away; for if I go not away, the Comforter will not come unto you; but if I go, I will send him unto you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he, when he is come, will convict the world in respect of sin, and of righteousness, and of judgment: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of sin, because they believe not on me; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of righteousness, because I go to the Father, and ye behold me no more; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of judgment, because the prince of this world hath been judged. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have yet many things to say unto you, but ye cannot bear them now. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Howbeit when he, the Spirit of truth, is come, he shall guide you into all the truth: for he shall not speak from himself; but what things soever he shall hear, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " shall he speak: and he shall declare unto you the things that are to come. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall glorify me: for he shall take of mine, and shall declare ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " unto you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All things whatsoever the Father hath are mine: therefore said I, that he taketh of mine, and shall declare ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " unto you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A little while, and ye behold me no more; and again a little while, and ye shall see me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of his disciples therefore said one to another, What is this that he saith unto us, A little while, and ye behold me not; and again a little while, and ye shall see me: and, Because I go to the Father? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They said therefore, What is this that he saith, A little while? We know not what he saith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus perceived that they were desirous to ask him, and he said unto them, Do ye inquire among yourselves concerning this, that I said, A little while, and ye behold me not, and again a little while, and ye shall see me? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Verily, verily, I say unto you, that ye shall weep and lament, but the world shall rejoice: ye shall be sorrowful, but your sorrow shall be turned into joy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A woman when she is in travail hath sorrow, because her hour is come: but when she is delivered of the child, she remembereth no more the anguish, for the joy that a man is born into the world. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And ye therefore now have sorrow: but I will see you again, and your heart shall rejoice, and your joy no one taketh away from you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And in that day ye shall ask me no question. Verily, verily, I say unto you, If ye shall ask anything of the Father, he will give it you in my name. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hitherto have ye asked nothing in my name: ask, and ye shall receive, that your joy may be made full.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These things have I spoken unto you in dark sayings: the hour cometh, when I shall no more speak unto you in dark sayings, but shall tell you plainly of the Father. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In that day ye shall ask in my name: and I say not unto you, that I will pray the Father for you; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the Father himself loveth you, because ye have loved me, and have believed that I came forth from the Father. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I came out from the Father, and am come into the world: again, I leave the world, and go unto the Father. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His disciples say, Lo, now speakest thou plainly, and speakest no dark saying. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now know we that thou knowest all things, and needest not that any man should ask thee: by this we believe that thou camest forth from God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered them, Do ye now believe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, the hour cometh, yea, is come, that ye shall be scattered, every man to his own, and shall leave me alone: and ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " I am not alone, because the Father is with me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These things have I spoken unto you, that in me ye may have peace. In the world ye have tribulation: but be of good cheer; I have overcome the world.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.16.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "JHN.17",
    "number": "17",
    "bookId": "JHN"
  },
